{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-factory-construction","title":"人工细胞工厂构建","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering/cell-factory-construction","wordCount":1736,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"人工细胞工厂构建\">人工细胞工厂构建</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>当代谢通路完成设计、关键酶完成改造后，将全部要素整合到一个底盘细胞中使其高效运行——这就是人工细胞工厂（Cell Factory）构建的核心任务。它是一个多维度的系统优化问题，需要协调基因表达、代谢平衡、细胞生理与进化稳定性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高产菌株筛选策略\">高产菌株筛选策略</h3><p>从文库到明星菌株的路径决定了细胞工厂的开发效率：</p>\n<p><strong>基于生长偶联的选择</strong>：将产物合成与细胞生长强制关联——如将产物为唯一碳源/氮源的降解酶过表达于宿主中，仅产量高的细胞能生存。适用于可建立选择压的产物。</p>\n<p><strong>高通量筛选（HTS）平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>微孔板筛选：96/384孔自动化平台，通量<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/天</li>\n<li>液滴微流控：皮升级液滴包裹单细胞，FACS分选，通量达<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/天</li>\n<li>生物传感器驱动：产物响应型荧光传感器实现实时单细胞分选</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适应性实验室进化（ALE）</strong>：在特定选择压下连续传代（100-1000代），利用自发突变积累获得适应性表型。优势在于无需预知分子靶点，可发现意想不到的有益突变。</p>\n<p>筛选通量与命中率的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{hit} = 1 - (1 - f_{beneficial})^{n_{screened}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当有益突变频率<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{beneficial} = 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>时，需筛选<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>个变体才有95%概率发现至少一个改善型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多基因协同调控\">多基因协同调控</h3><p>工业菌株通常需同时优化5-20个基因的表达水平，单基因逐一调优效率极低：</p>\n<p><strong>组合表达调控</strong>：使用不同强度启动子/RBS组合（如从弱到强5个梯度）构建多基因表达文库，结合高通量筛选找到最优组合。对<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>个基因、每个<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>文库大小</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{文库大小} = k^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">文库大小</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=5, k=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>时理论空间为3125种组合——仍可暴力筛选。</p>\n<p><strong>CRISPR多重调控</strong>：CRISPRi/CRISPRa同时抑制/激活多个靶基因，一次转化即可测试数千种调控组合。dCas9-sgRNA文库筛选已实现单轮优化10+基因。</p>\n<p><strong>模块化pathway平衡</strong>：将长通路分为上游模块（供应前体）与下游模块（合成产物），独立优化后通过模块接口连接：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;上游模块(前体供应)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;关键中间体&quot;| B[&quot;下游模块(产物合成)&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;辅因子再生模块&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    C --&gt; B&#10;    D[&quot;动态调控模块&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt; B\">graph LR\n    A[\"上游模块(前体供应)\"] --&gt;|\"关键中间体\"| B[\"下游模块(产物合成)\"]\n    C[\"辅因子再生模块\"] --&gt; A\n    C --&gt; B\n    D[\"动态调控模块\"] --&gt; A\n    D --&gt; B</pre><h3 id=\"生物传感器辅助高通量筛选\">生物传感器辅助高通量筛选</h3><p>将产物浓度转化为可检测信号（荧光/生长），是实现超高通量筛选的关键：</p>\n<p><strong>转录因子型传感器（TF-based）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>利用天然或工程化转录因子感知目标代谢物</li>\n<li>代谢物结合→TF构象变化→激活/抑制荧光报告基因</li>\n<li>已有传感器覆盖：丙二酰CoA、丙二酸、法尼醇、类异戊二烯等</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>核糖开关（Riboswitch）型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RNA适体直接感知配体，调控翻译起始</li>\n<li>响应速度快（秒级），无蛋白表达延迟</li>\n<li>可通过SELEX筛选人工适体扩展靶标范围</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>FRET/生物发光传感器</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>蛋白质FRET传感器可实时监测胞内代谢物浓度</li>\n<li>适合动态调控回路的在线反馈</li>\n</ul>\n<p>传感器关键性能指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>动态范围</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>灵敏度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{动态范围} = \\frac{F_{max}}{F_{min}}, \\quad \\text{灵敏度} = \\frac{\\Delta F / F_0}{\\Delta [ligand]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">动态范围</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">灵敏度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"自动化铸造平台-biofoundry\">自动化铸造平台（Biofoundry）</h3><p>Biofoundry将DBTL循环工业化——集成机器人自动化、信息管理系统与AI决策引擎：</p>\n<p><strong>核心组成</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>设计层（Design）</strong>：AI/ML算法推荐实验方案（如ART工具）</li>\n<li><strong>构建层（Build）</strong>：液体处理机器人自动完成DNA组装、转化、菌落挑取</li>\n<li><strong>测试层（Test）</strong>：自动化发酵（微型生物反应器阵列）与分析（自动化LC-MS）</li>\n<li><strong>学习层（Learn）</strong>：数据管理平台（LIMS）+ 机器学习模型迭代优化</li>\n</ol>\n<p>全球主要Biofoundry：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>美国JBEI（劳伦斯伯克利国家实验室）</li>\n<li>英国Edinburgh Genome Foundry</li>\n<li>中国天津工业生物技术研究所&quot;天工&quot;平台</li>\n<li>新加坡NUS Biofoundry</li>\n</ul>\n<p>自动化带来的效率提升：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DBTL周期</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext> days</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> day</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DBTL周期} = \\frac{t_{manual}}{n_{parallel} \\times \\eta_{automation}} \\approx \\frac{30\\ \\text{days}}{10 \\times 3} \\approx 1\\ \\text{day}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DBTL</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周期</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2642em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">days</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">day</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"进化稳定性保障\">进化稳定性保障</h3><p>高产菌株在长期传代或工业发酵中可能丢失工程功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基因组整合</strong>：多拷贝整合（δ位点、CRISPR多靶点）替代质粒表达，消除质粒丢失风险</li>\n<li><strong>毒素-抗毒素系统</strong>：质粒丢失细胞自杀，维持群体中含质粒细胞占比</li>\n<li><strong>必需基因锚定</strong>：将工程途径与生长必需基因偶联（生长选择）</li>\n<li><strong>进化陷阱（Evolutionary Trap）设计</strong>：使逃逸突变体（降低产量的回复突变）付出适应性代价</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年人工细胞工厂构建的关键进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>深圳合成生物创新中心的自动化Biofoundry实现&quot;7天从设计到测试100个菌株&quot;的标准化流程</li>\n<li>MIT团队使用强化学习agent自主设计DBTL实验——AI在3轮迭代中将番茄红素产量提升12倍，超越人类专家5轮方案</li>\n<li>&quot;通用型&quot;产物传感器文库发布：覆盖200+常见代谢物的标准化荧光传感器套件</li>\n<li>进化稳定性工程：合成&quot;依赖性回路&quot;（Addiction Circuit）使工业大肠杆菌连续发酵200代产量衰减&lt;5%</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>你想优化一个5基因的紫杉醇前体合成途径。每个基因测试3种表达强度。计算完全组合文库大小，并设计一个分两阶段的筛选策略使工作量可控。</li>\n<li>适应性实验室进化（ALE）与定向进化的核心区别是什么？各自适用于什么类型的优化目标？</li>\n<li>为什么转录因子型生物传感器的动态范围通常优于核糖开关？各自的响应时间特征如何？</li>\n<li>Biofoundry中&quot;学习层&quot;的机器学习模型如何利用前几轮实验数据预测新的最优组合？简述一种可能的算法框架。</li>\n<li>设计一个进化稳定性保障方案：确保一个高产丁醇大肠杆菌在500代连续培养后产量衰减&lt;10%。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>人工细胞工厂构建是一场多维度的系统优化工程——从单基因筛选到多基因组合优化，从人工判读到AI自主决策，从手动操作到全自动Biofoundry。生物传感器将&quot;测不到&quot;变为&quot;看得见&quot;，使超高通量筛选成为可能。自动化铸造平台将DBTL循环从月级压缩至天级，根本改变了菌株开发的经济学。而进化稳定性工程确保精心构建的工程功能不会在工业运行中因自然选择压力而丢失。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人工细胞工厂构建","id":"人工细胞工厂构建"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"高产菌株筛选策略","id":"高产菌株筛选策略"},{"level":3,"text":"多基因协同调控","id":"多基因协同调控"},{"level":3,"text":"生物传感器辅助高通量筛选","id":"生物传感器辅助高通量筛选"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化铸造平台（Biofoundry）","id":"自动化铸造平台-biofoundry"},{"level":3,"text":"进化稳定性保障","id":"进化稳定性保障"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"酶工程与生物催化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering/enzyme-engineering"},"next":{"title":"生物反应器动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/bioreactor-dynamics"}}